\item[S2] Andrej Dujella, Diophantine m-tuples, author-maintained survey (snapshot accessed 9 October 2026), Chapter 1, Definition 1.2 and paragraph on rational upper bounds. \url{https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dujella/dujella.github.io/master/intro.html}.
